{
  "meta": {
    "title": "The Keeper and the Whisper",
    "topic": "A lighthouse keeper who hears the sea say his name",
    "language": "English",
    "factuality": "fiction",
    "hook": "Every night, the sea whispered his name.",
    "note": "Example production. Original fictional story. Images are labelled placeholders."
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "text": "Every night for thirty years, the sea whispered his name.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Lone lighthouse on black rocks at night, moonlit swell, cold blue, wide shot",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene01.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0b1d33",
          "dim": 0.35
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Thomas kept the lighthouse alone, and he never once answered.",
      "transition": "slide-left",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Weathered keeper at a rain-streaked window, lamp glow on his face, close-up",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene02.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "pan-right",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#1b2a3a",
          "dim": 0.3
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The voice was gentle. Thomas, it said. Come down.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Dark water at the foot of the stairs, a faint pale glow under the surface",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene03.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "tilt-down",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0a2a2f",
          "dim": 0.35
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then a storm came, and a fishing boat vanished from the dark.",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Storm waves breaking over the rocks, lightning, tiny boat lights disappearing",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene04.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "pull-out",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#1a1a2e",
          "dim": 0.4
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The sea went silent. For the first time, Thomas spoke. Where are they?",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Keeper on the gallery rail in the storm, hands on the iron, desperate",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene05.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "drift",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#201a2b",
          "dim": 0.35
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The water answered. A ribbon of pale green light unrolled across the waves.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "A glowing green path across black ocean, seen from the lighthouse height",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene06.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#0b3a2e",
          "dim": 0.25
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He swung the great lamp along that path, until a small boat turned toward home.",
      "transition": "slide-up",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Lighthouse beam cutting through storm along the glowing path, boat turning",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene07.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "pan-left",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#16324f",
          "dim": 0.25
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At dawn the fishermen rowed in, alive. Thomas looked at the sea and said thank you.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Calm dawn, golden light on still water, small boat reaching the dock, keeper smiling",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene08.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "pull-out",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#4a3a22",
          "dim": 0.2
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It never whispered again. It had only ever wanted someone to answer.",
      "transition": "fade",
      "visual": {
        "prompt": "Empty calm sea at sunrise, keeper small on the rocks, wide and peaceful",
        "file": "images/placeholder_scene09.png",
        "source": "placeholder",
        "camera": "push-in",
        "atmosphere": {
          "tint": "#33405a",
          "dim": 0.2
        },
        "kind": "image"
      }
    }
  ],
